        "# Supplemental Evaluation Notes\n",
        "\n",
        "The strongest submissions connect the system-level hazards to the bracket-level calculations. Look for:\n",
        "\n",
        "- a complete load path from worker and tools to the platform, brackets, ladders, wall, and ground;\n",
